    "title": "GATEWAY-batchinsertion-List Fitness Memberships Historys-v3-spec",
    "description": "The Fitness Memberships History API provides access to the historical data of fitness memberships for users. This endpoint allows clients to retrieve comprehensive records of past memberships, highlighting the duration and status of each membership period. It is particularly useful for gym management systems, fitness apps, and customer service platforms aiming to provide users with insights into their membership history. Typical consumers include gym staff, fitness application developers, and users seeking to review their past engagement with fitness services.",
